</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S3.SS1.p2">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S3.SS1.p2.1">In the context of large language models (LLMs), the environment corresponds to the autoregressive generation process <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2507.07017v1#bib.bib24" title="">24</a>, <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2507.07017v1#bib.bib21" title="">21</a>]</cite>. Specifically:</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S3.SS1.p3">
