<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4">denote the softmax-normalized probability distribution over the vocabulary at step <math alttext="k" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1a"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1.1.cmml">k</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1b"><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1.1">𝑘</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1c">k</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.2.m1.1d">italic_k</annotation></semantics></math>, conditioned on the query <math alttext="q" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1a"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1.1.cmml">q</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1b"><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1.1">𝑞</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1c">q</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.3.m2.1d">italic_q</annotation></semantics></math> and previously generated tokens <math alttext="t_{&lt;k}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1a"><msub id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.2.cmml">t</mi><mrow id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.2" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.2.cmml"></mi><mo id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.1.cmml">&lt;</mo><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.3" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.3.cmml">k</mi></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1b"><apply id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.2">𝑡</ci><apply id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3"><lt id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.1"></lt><csymbol cd="latexml" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.2">absent</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1.1.3.3">𝑘</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1c">t_{&lt;k}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.4.m3.1d">italic_t start_POSTSUBSCRIPT &lt; italic_k end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1">We define the entropy of the policy at position <math alttext="k" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1a"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml">k</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1.1">𝑘</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1c">k</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p2.1.m1.1d">italic_k</annotation></semantics></math> as:</p>
