<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1">where each block <math alttext="B_{n}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">B</mi><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">n</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.2">𝐵</ci><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1.1.3">𝑛</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1c">B_{n}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p2.1.m1.1d">italic_B start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_n end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> contains the subsequence of tokens between two consecutive entropy-sensitive positions:</p>
