<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1">From the previously identified entropy-sensitive positions <math alttext="\mathcal{K}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1a"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml">𝒦</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1.1">𝒦</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1c">\mathcal{K}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.1.m1.1d">caligraphic_K</annotation></semantics></math>, we derive intermediate reasoning states:</p>
