<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right" rowspan="1"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3">representing the full reasoning state up to and including block <math alttext="B_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.2.cmml">B</mi><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.2">𝐵</ci><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1c">B_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.2.m1.1d">italic_B start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>, just prior to the entropy-sensitive position <math alttext="k_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1a"><msub id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.2.cmml">k</mi><mi id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.2">𝑘</ci><ci id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1c">k_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p3.3.m2.1d">italic_k start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS1.SSS4.p4.1">This entropy-based segmentation provides structure for localized policy refinement and targeted credit propagation. It enables fine-grained control over which segments of the trajectory receive higher attention during optimization. By grounding exploration in model-intrinsic uncertainty signals, FR3E facilitates robust discovery of high-reward reasoning paths, particularly in tasks with sparse rewards and complex action spaces.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section class="ltx_subsection" id="S4.SS2">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.2 </span>Entropy-Eliciting Explore: Diversified Path Sampling from Anchors</h3>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS2.p1">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS2.p1.2">For each intermediate state <math alttext="S_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1a"><msub id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1c">S_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS2.p1.1.m1.1d">italic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>, we reset the context and generate <math alttext="M" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1a"><mi id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml">M</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1.1">𝑀</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1c">M</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS2.p1.2.m2.1d">italic_M</annotation></semantics></math> diverse reasoning rollouts:</p>
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table" id="S4.E11">
<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math alttext="\mathcal{Y}_{j}:=\{Y_{j,m}\}_{m=1}^{M},\quad Y_{j,m}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid
S%
_{j})" class="ltx_math_unparsed" display="block" id="S4.E11.m1.4"><semantics id="S4.E11.m1.4a"><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.4b"><msub id="S4.E11.m1.4.5"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.E11.m1.4.5.2">𝒴</mi><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.5.3">j</mi></msub><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.6" lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:=</mo><msubsup id="S4.E11.m1.4.7"><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.2"><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.2.1" stretchy="false">{</mo><msub id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.2.2"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.2.2.2">Y</mi><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.2.2.2.4"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.1.1.1.1">j</mi><mo id="S4.E11.m1.2.2.2.4.1">,</mo><mi id="S4.E11.m1.2.2.2.2">m</mi></mrow></msub><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.2.3" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.3"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.3.2">m</mi><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.3.1">=</mo><mn id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.2.3.3">1</mn></mrow><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.7.3">M</mi></msubsup><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.8" rspace="1.167em">,</mo><msub id="S4.E11.m1.4.9"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.9.2">Y</mi><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.4.4.2.4"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.3.3.1.1">j</mi><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.4.2.4.1">,</mo><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.4.2.2">m</mi></mrow></msub><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.10">∼</mo><msub id="S4.E11.m1.4.11"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.11.2">π</mi><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.11.3">θ</mi></msub><mrow id="S4.E11.m1.4.12"><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.1" stretchy="false">(</mo><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.2" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.3" lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><msub id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.4"><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.4.2">S</mi><mi id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.4.3">j</mi></msub><mo id="S4.E11.m1.4.12.5" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.E11.m1.4c">\mathcal{Y}_{j}:=\{Y_{j,m}\}_{m=1}^{M},\quad Y_{j,m}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid
S%
_{j})</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.E11.m1.4d">caligraphic_Y start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT := { italic_Y start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j , italic_m end_POSTSUBSCRIPT } start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_m = 1 end_POSTSUBSCRIPT start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT italic_M end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT , italic_Y start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j , italic_m end_POSTSUBSCRIPT ∼ italic_π start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_θ end_POSTSUBSCRIPT ( ⋅ ∣ italic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT )</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right" rowspan="1"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS2.p2">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS2.p2.2">Each rollout <math alttext="Y_{j,m}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2a"><msub id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.2" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml">Y</mi><mrow id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.4" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml">j</mi><mo id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.4.1" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.2" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml">m</mi></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2b"><apply id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.3.2">𝑌</ci><list id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.4"><ci id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.1.1.1.1">𝑗</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2.2.2.2">𝑚</ci></list></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2c">Y_{j,m}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS2.p2.1.m1.2d">italic_Y start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j , italic_m end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> consists of a sequence of generated tokens extending from <math alttext="S_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1a"><msub id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mi id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><ci id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1c">S_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS2.p2.2.m2.1d">italic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>. We define its reward based on whether the generated answer is correct:</p>
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table" id="S4.E12">
