<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS3.p4.3">where <math alttext="|\mathcal{T}|" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.2" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml"><mo id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.2.1" stretchy="false" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.1.1.cmml">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.1.cmml">𝒯</mi><mo id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.2.2" stretchy="false" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.1.1.cmml">|</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1b"><apply id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.2"><abs id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.2.2.1"></abs><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1.1">𝒯</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1c">|\mathcal{T}|</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS3.p4.1.m1.1d">| caligraphic_T |</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the total number of tokens in the batch, and <math alttext="V(S_{j})" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">V</mi><mo id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">⁢</mo><mrow id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2" stretchy="false" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><msub id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mi id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><mo id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.3" stretchy="false" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1"><times id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.2"></times><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.3">𝑉</ci><apply id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1c">V(S_{j})</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS3.p4.2.m2.1d">italic_V ( italic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT )</annotation></semantics></math> is the empirical estimate of the value of state <math alttext="S_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1"><semantics id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1a"><msub id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml">S</mi><mi id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1b"><apply id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.2">𝑆</ci><ci id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1c">S_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS3.p4.3.m3.1d">italic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S4.SS3.p5">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S4.SS3.p5.2">Given that each trajectory in block <math alttext="j" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1"><semantics id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1a"><mi id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1.1.cmml">j</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1b"><ci id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1.1">𝑗</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1c">j</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS3.p5.1.m1.1d">italic_j</annotation></semantics></math> contributes exactly <math alttext="L_{j}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1"><semantics id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1a"><msub id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">L</mi><mi id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">j</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1b"><apply id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.2">𝐿</ci><ci id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1.1.3">𝑗</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1c">L_{j}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S4.SS3.p5.2.m2.1d">italic_L start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_j end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> tokens, the inner sum simplifies to:</p>
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table" id="S4.E17">
